<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 664 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 664 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 664 contracts compared with 246 overnight Thursday, according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 93 wheat, 209 corn, 339 soybean, 13 soymeal and ten soyoil contracts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1/4 to 2 cents higher, corn was down one to up one, and soybeans were 1/2 to 3 cents per bushel higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
